> <4>[   33.021805] serio serio0: device_attach() failed for isa0060/serio0=
 (i8042 KBD port), error: -517
> <4>[   33.021813] serio serio1: device_attach() failed for isa0060/serio1=
 (i8042 AUX port), error: -517
